{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T09:56:51.899614", "data": {"url": "https://www.tata.com/about-us/tata-group-our-heritage/timelines", "title": "A History Through Timelines | Tata group", "content": "The world looks best in a portrait mode. So does our website :) Please tilt and enjoy the experience. Filter Category All Clear Category Date Range Last 30 days Past 6 months Past 1 year Specific Dates Date from Date to Clear Date Range Search Results for Trending Tags Clear all Card Result We use cookies to give you a better experience. By using our website you agree to our policies . Sweet! Sorry, I\u2019m on a diet Heritage A History Through Timelines Explore Tata history through these timelines Founded over 150 years ago, the history of Tata group embodies, in many ways, the history of entrepreneurship, philanthropy and compassionate capitalism in India, and increasingly, the world. Explore its vibrant history through a set of timelines that briefly highlight major milestones in its growth. Defining Indian Hospitality, Since 1903 Ever since the opening of the first hotel, the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel in 1903, IHCL has brought Indian hospitality to the world. A history in pictures. Driving Through History \u201cOur object, as you know, is to undertake the manufacture of boilers, then locomotives and eventually engineering machinery. This transfer may, therefore, be said to constitute an important step forward in the country\u2019s march to self-sufficiency\" said JRD Tata. And a giant was born. Sports at Tata The story of the Tata group's involvement in sports started in 1885 when Jamsetji and Dorabji Tata helped set up the Parsee Gymkhana in Bombay. The association has grown exponentially since then. Life of JRD - A Timeline A timeline tracing the milestones in the rich, eventful life of the former group chairman JRD Tata. Photos courtesy Tata Central Archives. Since 1968: The TCS Timeline Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), founded in 1968, is an IT services, consulting, and business solutions organisation that partners with many of the world\u2019s largest businesses. Learn more about its history via this timeline. 2018 till date: The Next 50 The years since 2018 have seen many milestones. This timeline traces the group's contemporary history and is updated as the years pass. 1969-2017: The Expansion Years This period saw a series of bold global acquisitions and partnerships with a focus on new technology. 1917-1968: The Growth Years These years saw the birth of Indian aviation, the emergence of Tata Trusts, the foray into locomotives and heavy vehicles, and the formation of TCS - among other milestones. 1868-1917: The Early Years The ingenuity of Jamsetji Tata's vision, and the nation-building industries it inspired. His dreams - Tata Steel, Tata Power, IHCL, and the Indian Institute of Science saw fruition.", "lists": [["Switch to Dark Mode Switch to Light Mode"], ["Search"], ["Business Business Overview Learn more Our Brands Browse select Tata brands Business Verticals Technology Steel Automotive Consumer & Retail Infrastructure Financial Services Aerospace & Defence Tourism & Travel Telecom & Media Trading & Investments", "Business Overview", "", "Learn more", "Our Brands", "", "Browse select Tata brands", "Business Verticals", "", "Technology Steel Automotive Consumer & Retail Infrastructure Financial Services Aerospace & Defence Tourism & Travel Telecom & Media Trading & Investments", "Technology", "Steel", "Automotive", "Consumer & Retail", "Infrastructure", "Financial Services", "Aerospace & Defence", "Tourism & Travel", "Telecom & Media", "Trading & Investments", "Community Overview Areas of Work Health Education Empowerment Environment", "Overview", "", "Areas of Work", "Health Education Empowerment Environment", "Health", "Education", "Empowerment", "Environment", "About Us The Tata group About the Tata Group Tata Sons Values and Purpose Tata Code of Conduct Heritage Leadership Sponsorships Sustainability Innovation Books Inve